1
00:00:00,333 --> 00:00:01,666
Claude.

2
00:00:01,666 --> 00:00:04,000
Build me a million dollar app.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Make no mistakes.

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,666
Who is it for, brother?

5
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:08,000
People with money.

6
00:00:08,333 --> 00:00:10,000
You got a customer,

7
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,666
or just a revenue goal?

8
00:00:11,666 --> 00:00:14,000
My buddy runs a landscaping business.

9
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
He spends all night making quotes.

10
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Good. Ask him to show you

11
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,333
the last three.

12
00:00:19,333 --> 00:00:21,333
Then we build an AI quoting app?

13
00:00:21,333 --> 00:00:22,333
Then we find out

14
00:00:22,333 --> 00:00:24,000
where the time goes.

15
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,666
Measuring yards? Pricingjobs?

16
00:00:26,666 --> 00:00:29,000
Chasing people who never buy?

17
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,333
Three different problems.

18
00:00:30,333 --> 00:00:32,333
Exactly. Ask:

19
00:00:32,333 --> 00:00:34,333
show me the last time.

20
00:00:34,333 --> 00:00:35,666
What did you try?

21
00:00:35,666 --> 00:00:37,333
What did it cost you?

22
00:00:37,333 --> 00:00:39,666
Not, would you use my app?

23
00:00:39,666 --> 00:00:41,000
He is your friend.

24
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,000
He will say yes

25
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,333
and never log in.

26
00:00:43,666 --> 00:00:45,000
So where do you come in?

27
00:00:45,333 --> 00:00:47,000
Bring me those notes.

28
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,666
We separate what he said

29
00:00:48,666 --> 00:00:50,333
from what we are guessing.

30
00:00:50,333 --> 00:00:52,333
Pick one painful step.

31
00:00:52,333 --> 00:00:54,666
Build the smallest way to improve it.

32
00:00:54,666 --> 00:00:56,333
How do we know it works?

33
00:00:56,666 --> 00:00:58,666
Tryit on his next real quote.

34
00:00:58,666 --> 00:01:00,333
Measure the time saved.

35
00:01:00,333 --> 00:01:02,666
Then offer a paid pilot.

36
00:01:02,666 --> 00:01:04,000
Compliments are easy.

37
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Commitment tells you more.

38
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,333
So I need evidence,

39
00:01:07,333 --> 00:01:09,000
not a million dollar guess.

40
00:01:09,333 --> 00:01:10,666
Now you got it.

41
00:01:10,666 --> 00:01:13,000
I can help you build faster.

42
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,000
I cannot make people care.

43
00:01:15,333 --> 00:01:17,000
And the no mistakes part?

44
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,333
Make the first mistake

45
00:01:18,333 --> 00:01:20,333
small enough to learn from.

46
00:01:21,333 --> 00:01:23,000
Think we are using the right bait?

47
00:01:23,333 --> 00:01:24,333
Brother.

48
00:01:24,333 --> 00:01:26,333
You have not put any on.

